  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TEA Demonstrator - Scale-up of LEIA in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale-up of the Low Energy Inclusive Appliances (LEIA) project to deploy standalone off-grid solar appliances across three refugee camps in Rwanda, and model a basic energy-efficient appliance package for refugee families and an energy-efficient product procurement handbook.</narrative>
  </description>
